  "english": "29. Thursday. Tone 1 [AH]. The Sons of Thunder. Barekendan [eve] of the Nativity Fast. Perform the service in order.\n\nJanuary:\n1. Sunday. Tone 4 [BK]. Sixth [day] of the Fast. Evening Hymn [Hambartsi] Tone 2 [BK]: \"They anticipated\" (Kankhetsin) to the end.\n2. Monday. Tone 5 [GD]. Fast. Fathers [Harst] of Penance Tone 8 [DK]: \"Blessed art thou, Lord God of our fathers.\"\n5. Thursday. Tone 8 [DK]. Eve of the Nativity of Christ.\n\nRoman Septenary [Calendar Indicator] 5.\nFebruary:\n1. Monday. The Maccabees, Eleazar, and the others.\n2. Tuesday. The Twelve Prophets: Hosea and the others.\n4. Thursday. Sophia and her three daughters.\n6. Saturday. The sons and grandsons of the Enlightener, and the others.\n7. Sunday. Fourth [Sunday]. Barekendan [eve] of the Fast of Catechumens.\n14. Sunday. The Presentation of the Lord [Tyarnndaraj].\n28. Sunday. Tone 8 [DK]. Great Barekendan [eve of Great Lent]. See the others in order in the first volume, keeping the order of this place.\n\nApril:\n7. Wednesday. Tone 6 [GK]. Fast. Feast of the Annunciation of the Holy Virgin.\n18. Sunday. Tone 1 [AH]. Easter [Zatik]. Day of the Resurrection of Christ. See also the others in order in the first volume.\n\nMay:\n27. Thursday. Tone 8 [DK]. Ascension of Christ. And the others in order.\n\nJune:\n6. Sunday. Tone 2 [AK]. Pentecost (Coming of the Holy Spirit). Barekendan [eve] of the Elijah Fast.\n\nJanuary:\n6. Wednesday. Feast of the Nativity and Epiphany of Christ. The interval of eating meat is thirty-three days.\n14. Thursday. John the Forerunner [Karapet].\n16. Saturday. Peter the Patriarch, Blaise [Vlas], and the others.\n17. Sunday. First [after Epiphany]. Fathers [Harst] Tone 7 [DZ]: \"The dawning of the Only-Begotten.\"\n18. Monday. Anton the Hermit.\n19. Tuesday. Theodosius the King, and the Holy Infants of Ephesus.\n21. Thursday. Cyriacus [Kirakos] and Julietta, and Gordius, Polyeuctus, and Grigoris.\n23. Saturday. Patriarchs Athanasius and Cyril.\n24. Sunday. Second [after Epiphany]. Fathers [Harst] Tone 5 [GD]: \"Creator of creatures.\"\n25. Monday. Vahan of Goghtn, and Eugine the Virgin, and the others.\n26. Tuesday. Tryphon, Parsamas, and Onuphrius the Hermits.\n28. Thursday. Eugenius, Macarius, etc.\n30. Saturday. Gregory the Theologian.\n31. Sunday. Third [after Epiphany]. Fathers [Harst] Tone 6 [GK]: \"Today the immolated.\" For the three weeks placed here, see the first volume after the Transfiguration [Vardavar].",
